WEBVTT

00:06.637 --> 00:09.687
<b>[UNCLE] The nomads attacked,
defeating our militia.</b>

00:10.187 --> 00:12.977
<b>Without our forces,
it will be impossible</b>

00:13.017 --> 00:15.357
<b>to prevent them
from entering the city.</b>

00:16.437 --> 00:18.357
<b>When they arrive,
there'll be pillaging.</b>

00:18.777 --> 00:21.777
<b>So, we'll need to hide our food
and valuables before then.</b>

00:23.327 --> 00:26.827
<b>[Zumurrud grunts] We won't get
too much down here.</b>

00:27.787 --> 00:29.037
<b>[ANIS] Mm...</b>

00:30.617 --> 00:31.747
<b>[smirks]</b>

00:32.457 --> 00:33.587
<b>[BOTH] Uh?</b>

00:34.287 --> 00:35.997
<b>[both exclaim]</b>

00:36.587 --> 00:38.507
<b>I'll lead my sons
to the mountains,</b>

00:38.547 --> 00:40.377
<b>and we shall take shelter there.</b>

00:40.417 --> 00:42.297
<b>Yes, good idea.</b>

00:42.337 --> 00:43.387
<b>For right now,</b>

00:43.637 --> 00:46.057
<b>you and Sitara
need to hide down in the cellar.</b>

00:46.717 --> 00:48.637
<b>We will come back in three days.</b>

00:48.677 --> 00:51.687
<b>Sitara, I leave Ms. Fatima
in your hands.</b>

00:51.727 --> 00:53.647
<b>Sure! I'll keep her safe!</b>

00:53.687 --> 00:55.477
<b>And we'll be seeing you soon.</b>

00:55.517 --> 00:57.897
<b>-Till then...
-You two take care!</b>

00:58.897 --> 01:01.697
<b>[ANIS] Times like these bring me
back to my childhood.</b>

01:01.737 --> 01:04.277
<b>We fled our city more times
than I can count.</b>

01:04.317 --> 01:05.617
<b>[ZUMURRUD]
You should at least feel</b>

01:05.657 --> 01:07.447
<b>a little worried about all this!</b>

01:07.487 --> 01:08.947
<b>[ANIS] I suppose so.</b>

01:14.837 --> 01:17.457
<b>[SITARA] Mistress,
why don't you have some dates?</b>

01:18.297 --> 01:20.457
<b>[FATIMA]
That sounds nice. Thank you.</b>

01:22.467 --> 01:23.797
<b>In this cellar,</b>

01:23.927 --> 01:26.887
<b>it feels as though the world
has come to a complete stop.</b>

01:27.757 --> 01:30.017
<b>I can see the outside light
through here.</b>

01:30.057 --> 01:32.347
<b>It has already come and gone
three times now.</b>

01:33.137 --> 01:34.727
<b>So, that should mean Uncle
and the others</b>

01:34.767 --> 01:37.687
<b>will be coming to get us soon.
But still...</b>

01:37.727 --> 01:39.357
<b>If it takes them
a little longer,</b>

01:39.397 --> 01:41.447
<b>thanks to all their
preparations,</b>

01:41.487 --> 01:43.857
<b>we'll have plenty of supplies
to last us!</b>

01:43.907 --> 01:45.867
<b>And your books
are safe here, too!</b>

01:45.907 --> 01:47.117
<b>You're right.</b>

01:47.577 --> 01:48.787
<b>Thank you, Sitara.</b>

01:48.827 --> 01:51.157
<b>Having you with me
keeps my spirits high.</b>

01:51.197 --> 01:53.247
<b>I haven't done anything!</b>

01:53.917 --> 01:54.957
<b>Uh...</b>

01:55.787 --> 01:57.127
<b>Come to think of it.</b>

01:57.167 --> 01:58.877
<b>I wonder
if the nomads have read</b>

01:58.917 --> 02:00.917
<b>about Euclid's
different theorems.</b>

02:01.127 --> 02:02.587
<b>I'm not sure.</b>

02:02.627 --> 02:05.587
<b>That said, I mustn't lose
a single volume.</b>

02:05.637 --> 02:07.757
<b>My husband spent
his life collecting them.</b>

02:07.807 --> 02:09.057
<b>[Sitara exclaims]</b>

02:09.637 --> 02:10.717
<b>Yes, you're right.</b>

02:10.767 --> 02:13.517
<b>[Fatima chuckles]
Sitara, I'm curious.</b>

02:14.477 --> 02:16.307
<b>You care for Muhammad,
don't you?</b>

02:16.347 --> 02:19.267
<b>[Sitara gasps, stutters]</b>

02:19.937 --> 02:22.437
<b>Yes. I think highly of him.</b>

02:22.487 --> 02:24.947
<b>There can't be many people
in the world</b>

02:24.987 --> 02:26.317
<b>who are as intelligent.</b>

02:26.357 --> 02:27.567
<b>[Fatima chuckles softly]</b>

02:27.617 --> 02:29.657
<b>The boy takes after his father.</b>

02:30.367 --> 02:33.867
<b>Bridling at the restrictions
of conservative theology.</b>

02:35.537 --> 02:36.707
<b>But still...</b>

02:36.747 --> 02:39.087
<b>The more he walks
his own path in life,</b>

02:39.127 --> 02:42.337
<b>the more objections
and resistance he will face.</b>

02:42.707 --> 02:43.917
<b>In such times,</b>

02:44.087 --> 02:47.047
<b>there will be only one person
able to comfort him.</b>

02:48.297 --> 02:50.597
<b>Sitara, that would be you.</b>

02:50.637 --> 02:52.017
<b>[Sitara gasps]</b>

02:52.057 --> 02:54.307
<b>I want you to serve my son.</b>

02:54.347 --> 02:56.597
<b>As a human unto yourself.</b>

02:58.437 --> 03:00.567
<b>♪</b>

03:13.117 --> 03:14.327
<b>[Sitara breathes softly]</b>

03:14.367 --> 03:16.077
<b>[Fatima chuckles]</b>

03:16.577 --> 03:18.327
<b>[Sitara breathes shakily]</b>

03:18.957 --> 03:20.207
<b>I will.</b>

03:25.167 --> 03:27.417
<b>-[footsteps]
-[thumping]</b>

03:27.467 --> 03:28.637
<b>[SITARA AND FATIMA] Uh?</b>

03:28.677 --> 03:30.467
<b>[FATIMA] It's my brother
and the girls.</b>

03:30.507 --> 03:32.097
<b>We can finally come out.</b>

03:32.137 --> 03:33.557
<b>[SITARA] Yes!</b>

03:37.687 --> 03:38.847
<b>[BOTH] Hm.</b>

03:43.267 --> 03:44.607
<b>[both grunt]</b>

03:45.817 --> 03:47.147
<b>[Sitara gasps]</b>

03:47.487 --> 03:48.697
<b>[Fatima exhales]</b>

03:52.737 --> 03:53.827
<b>[SITARA] Uh?</b>

03:55.037 --> 03:56.407
<b>[Sitara breathes uneasily]</b>

03:56.447 --> 03:58.287
<b>[footsteps approaching]</b>

04:06.627 --> 04:08.047
<b>[Sitara breathes uneasily]</b>

04:10.837 --> 04:12.637
<b>[TOLUI] Ah...</b>

04:16.847 --> 04:19.017
<b>[♪ opening theme song playing]</b>

05:44.017 --> 05:46.267
<b>[Sitara grunts]</b>

05:47.567 --> 05:48.607
<b>[gasps]</b>

05:56.277 --> 05:57.777
<b>I thank you, Sitara.</b>

05:57.827 --> 05:59.077
<b>[SITARA] Of course.</b>

05:59.577 --> 06:01.247
<b>-Stand back.
-[Sitara gasps]</b>

06:03.537 --> 06:04.497
<b>[Sitara grunts]</b>

06:04.537 --> 06:05.627
<b>Sitara.</b>

06:06.127 --> 06:08.167
<b>Don't offer resistance.</b>

06:09.337 --> 06:10.457
<b>Yes...</b>

06:10.957 --> 06:12.377
<b>Mistress.</b>

06:16.467 --> 06:17.637
<b>[SHIRA] Uh?</b>

06:20.007 --> 06:21.137
<b>[Shira chuckles]</b>

06:24.477 --> 06:26.017
<b>[thudding]</b>

06:32.067 --> 06:33.947
<b>[Sitara and Fatima
breathe uneasily]</b>

06:48.457 --> 06:49.997
<b>[Fatima breathes shakily]</b>

06:50.047 --> 06:52.837
<b>[Fatima, in English]
No! Not that book!</b>

07:03.057 --> 07:04.307
<b>[laughs]</b>

07:19.567 --> 07:21.237
<b>[Fatima breathes shakily]</b>

07:25.697 --> 07:26.787
<b>[grunts]</b>

07:26.997 --> 07:29.327
<b>[in English] "Whether they are
a man or woman,</b>

07:29.377 --> 07:30.707
<b>cut off the hands of thieves</b>

07:30.747 --> 07:33.297
<b>as punishment for the awful deed
they have done!"</b>

07:34.167 --> 07:36.217
<b>-Sitara!
-It's not right.</b>

07:36.257 --> 07:39.677
<b>That book doesn't belong to you,
so you must give it back!</b>

08:00.567 --> 08:04.197
<b>[in English] My Master says
you are not to call him a thief.</b>

08:04.237 --> 08:05.197
<b>"Everything on this..."</b>

08:05.487 --> 08:07.197
<b>[SITARA] This boy understands
our language.</b>

08:07.247 --> 08:09.207
<b>"...The Genghis Khan."</b>

08:11.207 --> 08:12.337
<b>[both gasp]</b>

08:25.137 --> 08:26.387
<b>[Sitara trembles]</b>

08:26.557 --> 08:27.807
<b>-[Shira breathes shakily]
-[Fatima, in English] No!</b>

08:31.517 --> 08:34.107
<b>[Fatima screams, echoes]</b>

08:38.487 --> 08:39.817
<b>[Sitara gasps]</b>

08:51.077 --> 08:52.167
<b>[SITARA] Uh...</b>

08:52.707 --> 08:54.917
<b>-Mistress?
-[Fatima breathes weakly]</b>

08:59.587 --> 09:00.917
<b>Don't you...</b>

09:02.177 --> 09:03.927
<b>dare touch...</b>

09:04.507 --> 09:05.757
<b>[breathes shakily]</b>

09:07.427 --> 09:10.597
<b>my beloved daughter.</b>

09:11.687 --> 09:13.187
<b>[Sitara whimpers]</b>

09:13.767 --> 09:14.897
<b>Mistress?</b>

09:15.477 --> 09:19.527
<b>Mistress? Mistress! [cries]</b>

09:20.897 --> 09:22.817
<b>[wails]</b>

09:31.907 --> 09:33.287
<b>♪</b>

09:41.217 --> 09:43.547
<b>[Sitara gasps softly]</b>

09:49.927 --> 09:52.267
<b>[Sitara breathes shakily]</b>

10:08.487 --> 10:09.907
<b>[SITARA] Uh?</b>

10:44.487 --> 10:45.647
<b>[SITARA] Uh?</b>

10:51.027 --> 10:52.117
<b>[ANIS] Uh?</b>

10:52.157 --> 10:53.657
<b>Sitara?</b>

10:54.037 --> 10:55.037
<b>[Zumurrud gasps]</b>

10:55.077 --> 10:56.247
<b>[Anis gasps]</b>

10:58.747 --> 11:01.457
<b>[ANIS] Oh, you're alive.</b>

11:02.417 --> 11:03.877
<b>Are you hurt?</b>

11:05.007 --> 11:07.637
<b>Ms. Anis, I... I, uh...</b>

11:08.547 --> 11:12.637
<b>[tearfully]
I didn't keep my promise...</b>

11:13.177 --> 11:15.517
<b>to keep the Mistress safe.</b>

11:15.557 --> 11:17.347
<b>-The Mistress is...
-[Sitara cries]</b>

11:18.397 --> 11:19.607
<b>[ANIS] Oh...</b>

11:22.817 --> 11:24.817
<b>They had captured us</b>

11:24.857 --> 11:27.527
<b>as we were all making our way
up to the mountains.</b>

11:27.567 --> 11:29.277
<b>[Zumurrud and Anis laugh]</b>

11:30.907 --> 11:31.987
<b>[both gasp]</b>

11:32.407 --> 11:35.697
<b>[ANIS] After that, we were
divided into smaller groups.</b>

11:36.577 --> 11:40.377
<b>Women, children,
and skilled craftsmen.</b>

11:40.997 --> 11:44.417
<b>Then, the men and the elderly
were rounded up</b>

11:44.457 --> 11:46.337
<b>and taken away somewhere.</b>

11:46.377 --> 11:49.047
<b>We haven't seen Uncle since.</b>

11:51.637 --> 11:52.717
<b>And then...</b>

11:52.757 --> 11:54.757
<b>[men groaning]</b>

11:56.677 --> 11:58.477
<b>[Zumurrud cries] Mikhail!</b>

12:08.357 --> 12:10.567
<b>[cries] Mikhail!</b>

12:12.157 --> 12:13.237
<b>[SITARA] Oh, no.</b>

12:14.697 --> 12:16.407
<b>Ms. Zumurrud...</b>

12:23.247 --> 12:24.667
<b>[cries]</b>

12:24.707 --> 12:27.417
<b>[in English] Please, you have to
stop crying. [shushes]</b>

12:27.467 --> 12:29.047
<b>Now be a good baby.</b>

12:29.087 --> 12:30.427
<b>Ms. Zumurrud...</b>

12:30.467 --> 12:32.257
<b>can you stand?</b>

12:32.297 --> 12:34.677
<b>-[horse neighs]
-[grunting]</b>

12:34.717 --> 12:36.387
<b>[ANIS] Have you got her?</b>

12:44.107 --> 12:45.187
<b>[SITARA] Uh?</b>

12:45.937 --> 12:47.107
<b>I know him.</b>

12:47.687 --> 12:51.107
<b>He's the ironmonger who fixed
that water basin for us.</b>

12:52.867 --> 12:55.407
<b>We must find Uncle
and the others soon!</b>

12:56.327 --> 12:58.617
<b>[woman screaming]</b>

13:02.917 --> 13:06.037
<b>[gasps] Hasan! Hasan!</b>

13:09.217 --> 13:10.467
<b>[woman groans]</b>

13:11.797 --> 13:12.927
<b>[SOLDIER] Chuu!</b>

13:16.307 --> 13:18.977
<b>[SITARA (ADULT)] Their fear
of these mysterious men</b>

13:19.677 --> 13:24.557
<b>spurred Sitara and the others
forward into the vast wasteland.</b>

13:28.397 --> 13:30.647
<b>[SITARA] This year,
the month of Safar</b>

13:30.687 --> 13:32.447
<b>still feels a little chilly,</b>

13:32.487 --> 13:34.157
<b>so the water is cold.</b>

13:36.407 --> 13:37.697
<b>Although...</b>

13:37.737 --> 13:39.117
<b>when the sun is out,</b>

13:39.157 --> 13:42.537
<b>I see the rose buds
are already starting to swell.</b>

13:46.247 --> 13:48.757
<b>As Anis and I are doing
our chores...</b>

13:48.797 --> 13:51.217
<b>[CHILDREN]
"In the mighty name of Allah,</b>

13:51.257 --> 13:52.917
<b>the Most Gracious..."</b>

13:52.967 --> 13:54.637
<b>[SITARA] We can hear
Uncle's students</b>

13:54.677 --> 13:56.757
<b>practicing their
recitation together.</b>

13:57.427 --> 13:59.057
<b>-How adorable.
-[Sitara chuckles]</b>

13:59.847 --> 14:02.267
<b>It reminds me
of when I first came out here!</b>

14:03.267 --> 14:04.347
<b>[exclaims]</b>

14:04.387 --> 14:06.017
<b>They've returned!</b>

14:08.147 --> 14:10.067
<b>Hello, Mistress, welcome home!</b>

14:10.567 --> 14:12.437
<b>So how was the bazaar today?</b>

14:12.487 --> 14:13.987
<b>Thanks to Zumurrud,</b>

14:14.027 --> 14:16.027
<b>I found quite a few
bargains there.</b>

14:16.067 --> 14:18.657
<b>That's because I'm always
at your service.</b>

14:18.697 --> 14:21.247
<b>[Fatima laughs] That's true.</b>

14:21.287 --> 14:23.827
<b>Sitara, you'll have to
come with us next time.</b>

14:23.867 --> 14:24.957
<b>Great!</b>

14:25.207 --> 14:28.087
<b>By the way, I just sent a letter
off to Nishapur.</b>

14:28.497 --> 14:31.757
<b>As the roses bloom,
a reply might arrive.</b>

14:31.797 --> 14:33.127
<b>[Sitara exclaims]</b>

14:34.757 --> 14:38.007
<b>[SITARA] After Safar comes
the month of Rabi' al-Awwal,</b>

14:38.047 --> 14:39.717
<b>when the roses bloom.</b>

14:40.007 --> 14:42.307
<b>At least, when they should have.</b>

14:42.347 --> 14:44.687
<b>[Sitara cries]</b>

14:52.687 --> 14:56.147
<b>[ANIS] Zumurrud, you must eat
to keep up your energy.</b>

14:56.197 --> 14:57.237
<b>[Zumurrud groans]</b>

14:58.197 --> 15:00.447
<b>And you as well.
So, go on then.</b>

15:01.157 --> 15:03.247
<b>[SITARA] You have it, Ms. Anis.</b>

15:03.287 --> 15:04.407
<b>[Anis exhales]</b>

15:04.457 --> 15:05.867
<b>[ANIS] Thank you.</b>

15:05.907 --> 15:08.917
<b>But this share here
is all yours.</b>

15:10.207 --> 15:11.997
<b>Hey, tell me.</b>

15:13.127 --> 15:14.627
<b>Do you remember when I said</b>

15:14.667 --> 15:17.547
<b>slaves don't get
to decide things for themselves?</b>

15:19.297 --> 15:20.347
<b>[SITARA] Yes.</b>

15:20.387 --> 15:22.427
<b>Viewed in another way,</b>

15:22.847 --> 15:26.227
<b>it means slaves aren't
responsible for things, either.</b>

15:27.227 --> 15:30.397
<b>For instance, even if one
were to commit a crime,</b>

15:30.437 --> 15:33.777
<b>their punishment is only half
that of somebody who's free.</b>

15:33.817 --> 15:35.027
<b>[Sitara gasps softly]</b>

15:35.067 --> 15:37.237
<b>[ANIS] I suppose
you could say they think</b>

15:37.277 --> 15:40.317
<b>we aren't capable of answering
for our own behavior.</b>

15:41.737 --> 15:45.367
<b>When it comes to the Mistress,
you mustn't decide for yourself</b>

15:45.407 --> 15:47.497
<b>whether you're
accountable or not.</b>

15:49.077 --> 15:51.747
<b>[Sitara cries]
Then who decides it?</b>

15:52.417 --> 15:54.837
<b>There's no one left who can!</b>

15:54.877 --> 15:59.177
<b>The Mistress or Uncle.
They're both... [cries]</b>

15:59.217 --> 16:00.467
<b>That's true.</b>

16:01.047 --> 16:02.137
<b>Wait,</b>

16:02.887 --> 16:06.847
<b>there is still one person
who's in Nishapur.</b>

16:09.387 --> 16:10.687
<b>[Sitara breathes shakily]</b>

16:12.767 --> 16:14.107
<b>Yes, that's right.</b>

16:14.977 --> 16:16.277
<b>[Anis chuckles]</b>

16:17.567 --> 16:21.277
<b>Master Muhammad's out there.
He's still alive!</b>

16:22.367 --> 16:23.407
<b>[ANIS] That's right.</b>

16:24.117 --> 16:26.997
<b>So, you see then.
We still have one person left.</b>

16:27.037 --> 16:28.747
<b>[Sitara breathes shakily]</b>

16:30.577 --> 16:31.747
<b>[Anis chuckles softly]</b>

16:38.717 --> 16:40.257
<b>We... [cries]</b>

16:41.967 --> 16:43.637
<b>We do! [cries]</b>

16:43.677 --> 16:45.717
<b>[Zumurrud cries]</b>

16:47.217 --> 16:48.427
<b>[SITARA (ADULT)] Soon...</b>

16:48.477 --> 16:51.187
<b>the prisoners continued
moving eastward.</b>

16:51.517 --> 16:54.107
<b>Day after day,
they traveled...</b>

16:57.277 --> 17:01.107
<b>...threading between mountains,
crossing rivers.</b>

17:01.317 --> 17:04.987
<b>And then, just as Safar
was ending...</b>

17:11.667 --> 17:14.207
<b>[Sitara (adult), in English]
The caravan came to a stop,</b>

17:14.247 --> 17:16.207
<b>arriving at a group of tents.</b>

17:16.247 --> 17:19.297
<b>Pitched in a place
called Taloqan.</b>

17:22.217 --> 17:23.587
<b>[sheep bleating]</b>

17:24.597 --> 17:25.927
<b>[GIRL] Uh?</b>

17:28.307 --> 17:31.387
<b>[SITARA] There are people here
who aren't soldiers.</b>

17:31.427 --> 17:33.097
<b>Could this be their city?</b>

17:34.557 --> 17:37.357
<b>[CRAFTSMAN] Excuse me,
where do you all hail from?</b>

17:37.397 --> 17:38.647
<b>[all gasp]</b>

17:38.687 --> 17:39.897
<b>From Tus.</b>

17:39.937 --> 17:41.317
<b>[craftsman breathes uneasily]</b>

17:41.357 --> 17:43.357
<b>[CRAFTSMAN] You mean
they even conquered Tus?</b>

17:43.407 --> 17:45.907
<b>[breathes uneasily]
Where are you from?</b>

17:45.947 --> 17:47.277
<b>They spared us.</b>

17:47.327 --> 17:50.247
<b>After we identified ourselves
as skilled craftsmen,</b>

17:50.287 --> 17:51.957
<b>they brought us down here...</b>

17:52.247 --> 17:53.417
<b>[exhales]</b>

17:53.827 --> 17:54.957
<b>...from Nishapur.</b>

17:55.537 --> 17:56.667
<b>[Sitara gasps]</b>

17:56.917 --> 17:58.297
<b>♪</b>

17:58.547 --> 18:00.837
<b>[CRAFTSMAN] After we learned
the nomads were approaching,</b>

18:00.877 --> 18:03.007
<b>we fortified our defenses.</b>

18:06.637 --> 18:09.347
<b>Then at the very moment
they descended upon us,</b>

18:09.387 --> 18:12.807
<b>a single arrow fired
from the ramparts.</b>

18:13.097 --> 18:16.097
<b>Found its mark and struck down
their commander.</b>

18:19.777 --> 18:22.777
<b>And in retaliation
for that one arrow,</b>

18:22.817 --> 18:26.987
<b>the city of Nishapur was
completely burned to the ground!</b>

18:39.547 --> 18:40.747
<b>[Craftsman, in English]
We skilled craftsmen</b>

18:40.797 --> 18:42.877
<b>are the only people
who survived.</b>

18:42.917 --> 18:45.547
<b>The others,
even our children were...</b>

18:47.007 --> 18:48.097
<b>[Sitara gasps softly]</b>

18:48.757 --> 18:52.267
<b>[SITARA] Master Muhammad
was in Nishapur.</b>

18:57.937 --> 18:59.357
<b>Can't be...</b>

18:59.397 --> 19:00.567
<b>[Zumurrud grunts]</b>

19:01.647 --> 19:02.777
<b>[all gasp]</b>

19:02.817 --> 19:04.317
<b>[ANIS] Zumurrud!</b>

19:04.357 --> 19:05.987
<b>[SITARA] Ms. Zumurrud!</b>

19:06.447 --> 19:08.407
<b>[Zumurrud groans]</b>

19:09.237 --> 19:10.697
<b>Mikhail...</b>

19:10.737 --> 19:11.987
<b>Mikhail.</b>

19:12.037 --> 19:13.327
<b>Uh?</b>

19:13.827 --> 19:15.287
<b>Zumurrud.</b>

19:16.287 --> 19:17.877
<b>[ZUMURRUD] The setting sun.</b>

19:18.247 --> 19:22.497
<b>It's so bright,
isn't it, Mikhail?</b>

19:22.917 --> 19:25.507
<b>-[waves lapping]
-[birds screeching]</b>

19:26.547 --> 19:29.347
<b>[ZUMURRUD] And so beautiful.</b>

19:31.887 --> 19:33.767
<b>-[Sitara and Anis gasp]
-[SITARA] Ms. Zumurrud!</b>

19:33.807 --> 19:35.057
<b>[ANIS] Please, no!</b>

19:35.097 --> 19:36.517
<b>Don't leave us!</b>

19:36.557 --> 19:38.187
<b>I'm begging of you!</b>

19:38.227 --> 19:39.937
<b>[both crying]</b>

19:39.977 --> 19:42.687
<b>[SITARA] Ms. Zumurrud
came from a distant land</b>

19:42.727 --> 19:44.987
<b>where she could watch the sea!</b>

19:45.317 --> 19:49.197
<b>She served the mistress
longer than any of us.</b>

19:49.867 --> 19:53.947
<b>Did she want to return
there the whole time?</b>

19:54.657 --> 19:58.207
<b>Did she miss her family
the whole time?</b>

19:58.247 --> 20:00.077
<b>[Sitara cries]</b>

20:01.627 --> 20:05.917
<b>[ANIS] We must give her
a proper burial at least.</b>

20:06.377 --> 20:09.837
<b>And reunite her
with her brother.</b>

20:10.797 --> 20:13.757
<b>[SITARA] "Indeed.
We all belong to Allah."</b>

20:14.057 --> 20:17.927
<b>[ALL] "And indeed,
to Him we shall return."</b>

20:29.737 --> 20:31.237
<b>[Sitara snores]</b>

20:33.157 --> 20:36.117
<b>Now there is no joy.</b>

20:42.587 --> 20:44.667
<b>-[birds chirping]
-[flock bleating]</b>

20:45.167 --> 20:46.627
<b>[WOMAN 1] Poor thing.</b>

20:46.667 --> 20:48.127
<b>[WOMAN 2] What happened?</b>

20:48.377 --> 20:49.547
<b>[Sitara gasps]</b>

20:49.587 --> 20:51.047
<b>Excuse me.</b>

20:51.087 --> 20:52.047
<b>[gasps]</b>

20:53.217 --> 20:55.717
<b>[WOMAN 1] She lunged
at a soldier who was walking by.</b>

20:55.767 --> 20:56.767
<b>[Sitara gasps]</b>

20:56.807 --> 20:58.597
<b>And then he just
struck her down.</b>

20:58.637 --> 21:00.187
<b>[WOMAN 2] How dreadful!</b>

21:00.227 --> 21:02.517
<b>So why is everyone just...</b>

21:05.017 --> 21:06.977
<b>[CRAFTSMAN]
Peace be upon her soul.</b>

21:09.067 --> 21:11.567
<b>[SITARA]
She decided for herself.</b>

21:11.607 --> 21:14.117
<b>Rather than becoming a slave
to the nomads</b>

21:14.157 --> 21:15.827
<b>for the rest of her life,</b>

21:16.197 --> 21:17.537
<b>Ms. Anis wanted to die</b>

21:17.577 --> 21:21.537
<b>while she was still a slave
to her Tus family.</b>

21:25.997 --> 21:27.377
<b>I know.</b>

21:27.957 --> 21:30.337
<b>If I keep walking
straight ahead,</b>

21:31.007 --> 21:33.507
<b>maybe someone will shoot
an arrow into me.</b>

21:39.137 --> 21:40.267
<b>[SHIRA] Wait!</b>

21:41.307 --> 21:42.557
<b>[Sitara gasps]</b>

21:42.597 --> 21:44.227
<b>[SITARA] It's that boy.</b>

21:47.687 --> 21:49.857
<b>[Sitara grunting]</b>

21:50.487 --> 21:51.817
<b>[Shira grunts]</b>

21:52.697 --> 21:54.527
<b>It's not... it's not like that!</b>

21:54.867 --> 21:56.447
<b>-Hey, listen!
-[Sitara crying]</b>

21:56.487 --> 21:58.987
<b>You wanna get that book back,
don't you?</b>

22:03.457 --> 22:05.167
<b>[Sitara gasps softly]</b>

22:10.007 --> 22:12.627
<b>[♪ closing theme song playing]</b>

23:38.427 --> 23:41.387
<b>[SITARA (ADULT)] Next time,
"An Undying Flame."</b>
